<%- include('partials/head') %><%- include('partials/nav') %>
<section class="pilgrimage-page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow light-eyebrow">TRAVEL WITH MEANING</div><h1>Pilgrimage tours<br><em>across India.</em></h1><p>Respectful, flexible journeys for sacred places, spiritual traditions and cultural heritage.</p><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Pilgrimage tours</div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">CHOOSE YOUR JOURNEY</div><h2>Paths for every <em>tradition.</em></h2><p class="section-intro">Explore by region and interest. We'll help you confirm practical arrangements before you travel.</p></div></div><div class="pilgrim-groups"><% groups.forEach((g,i)=>{ %><div class="pilgrim-group"><span class="group-number">0<%= i+1 %></span><div><h3><%= g.name %></h3><p><%= g.items %></p></div><a href="/pilgrimage-tours/<%= g.slug %>" aria-label="Explore <%= g.name %> journey">↗</a></div><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">START WITH A SAMPLE IDEA</div><h2>Pilgrimage & heritage <em>packages.</em></h2></div></div><div class="package-grid"><% packages.forEach(p=>{ %><%- include('partials/package-card',{p}) %><% }) %></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="advisory"><span class="advisory-icon">ⓘ</span><div><h3>Important travel advisory</h3><p>Some routes require registration, permits, seasonal access or health and fitness preparation. Opening dates, weather, transport and darshan access may change. Verify current official guidance before booking; no access or darshan is guaranteed.</p></div></div></section>
